1
00:01:41,990 --> 00:01:49,020
[Genius Girlfriend]

2
00:01:49,690 --> 00:01:51,830
[Episode 7]

3
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:56,420
Tang Tingting!

4
00:01:58,310 --> 00:01:59,120
Lin Zhixia?

5
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:00,800
What's wrong?

6
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,140
I want to apologize to you.

7
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:05,280
For what?

8
00:02:07,350 --> 00:02:08,280
We lost

9
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:11,000
the math contest, because of my arrogance

10
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,400
and mistaken decisions—

11
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:13,730
I'm so sorry about that.

12
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,750
It's all in the past.

13
00:02:16,190 --> 00:02:16,840
No.

14
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:19,560
If you hadn't participated
in this contest,

15
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:20,910
I probably would have failed already

16
00:02:20,910 --> 00:02:22,170
when forming the team.

17
00:02:22,590 --> 00:02:25,050
Then, we made a plan
for intensive training.

18
00:02:25,710 --> 00:02:27,150
But at the last moment,

19
00:02:28,030 --> 00:02:29,960
I ignored my teammates' opinions.

20
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,870
I think my distrust at the time

21
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,360
must have hurt you.

22
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:39,190
Let me tell you something funny.

23
00:02:40,310 --> 00:02:41,120
What is it?

24
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,750
An underachiever who

25
00:02:43,750 --> 00:02:45,430
got into the experimental class by luck

26
00:02:45,430 --> 00:02:47,470
signed up for the provincial math contest

27
00:02:47,470 --> 00:02:49,270
and aimed for the championship.

28
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,620
During the finals,

29
00:02:50,910 --> 00:02:53,030
she blamed herself for getting
a mandatory question wrong

30
00:02:53,030 --> 00:02:54,360
and almost broke down.

31
00:02:55,030 --> 00:02:56,030
After pulling herself together,

32
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:58,590
she decided to turn the tide
with a decision

33
00:02:58,750 --> 00:03:00,080
and secure the championship.

34
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,120
After the contest,

35
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:03,120
she was full of remorse

36
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,710
for only winning runner-up.

37
00:03:04,710 --> 00:03:06,360
With her mother's encouragement
and comfort,

38
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:07,890
she finally found herself.

39
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,430
She finally remembered—

40
00:03:09,430 --> 00:03:11,690
she was just an underachiever after all.

41
00:03:13,710 --> 00:03:15,960
Lin Zhixia, if it weren't for you,

42
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:18,760
I wouldn't have
so many inspiring stories to tell.

43
00:03:23,030 --> 00:03:24,150
I just don't know

44
00:03:24,150 --> 00:03:26,210
the next time there's a contest like this,

45
00:03:26,210 --> 00:03:27,740
will Lin Zhixia think of me?

46
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,160
Of course!

47
00:03:32,870 --> 00:03:33,470
Next time,

48
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,370
the time after next,

49
00:03:35,430 --> 00:03:36,150
and the time after that,

50
00:03:36,150 --> 00:03:37,280
we will always be teammates.

51
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:37,870
Okay!

52
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,090
Let's go.

53
00:03:47,370 --> 00:03:48,230
Listen to this.

54
00:03:48,860 --> 00:03:50,920
My idol's new song.
It's really good.

55
00:03:59,180 --> 00:04:00,740
This medal is really nice.

56
00:04:01,020 --> 00:04:02,350
Look at that engraving.

57
00:04:08,500 --> 00:04:08,930
Tang!

58
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:16,860
You've been wearing that medal for days.

59
00:04:16,860 --> 00:04:18,660
Aren't you afraid of getting a heat rash?

60
00:04:18,660 --> 00:04:19,930
This heavy medal

61
00:04:19,930 --> 00:04:21,730
is about to bend your small body.

62
00:04:21,769 --> 00:04:27,410
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

63
00:04:24,630 --> 00:04:25,920
Achievements

64
00:04:26,450 --> 00:04:28,250
are always heavy.

65
00:04:28,620 --> 00:04:30,880
I'd rather my body be bent a little lower.

66
00:04:31,620 --> 00:04:34,980
The ripe ear of wheat hangs low.

67
00:04:44,330 --> 00:04:45,390
Still annoyed?

68
00:04:47,750 --> 00:04:48,600
It doesn't matter.

69
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:50,040
There will be a next time.

70
00:04:51,159 --> 00:04:52,420
You don't understand.

71
00:04:52,510 --> 00:04:54,310
It's really very hard this time.

72
00:04:57,300 --> 00:04:58,830
What are you talking about?

73
00:05:01,770 --> 00:05:03,300
What are you talking about?

74
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:05,560
Aren't we talking about the contest?

75
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,240
I'm talking about

76
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:08,240
Han Geng's first concert here.

77
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,720
All that talk—

78
00:05:12,010 --> 00:05:13,160
what you were calling hard was...

79
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:14,420
It's hard to buy the tickets.

80
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:15,560
I've prepared the money,

81
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,830
but I can't get a ticket.

82
00:05:16,830 --> 00:05:19,290
My last resort would be going to queue
at 3 AM.

83
00:05:19,830 --> 00:05:22,240
Tang Tingting. Tang Tingting.

84
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,870
You can't just be obsessed...

85
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,600
with chasing celebrities.

86
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,000
Can't you be more like me?

87
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,800
I only care about studying.

88
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:33,830
Duan Qiyan, let me give you some advice.

89
00:05:33,830 --> 00:05:34,630
Go ahead.

90
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:37,360
Eighty years from now,
write on your epitaph,

91
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,890
"In the 10th-grade math contest,

92
00:05:38,890 --> 00:05:39,810
I won first prize.

93
00:05:39,810 --> 00:05:40,980
Try doing that too."

94
00:05:45,190 --> 00:05:46,480
That's...

95
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:48,720
quite a good idea.

96
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:58,010
Help a sis out.

97
00:05:56,810 --> 00:05:59,290
[Han Geng fans group chat]

98
00:05:58,010 --> 00:05:59,390
Who has tickets?

99
00:06:01,510 --> 00:06:03,260
[Han Geng fans group chat]

100
00:06:03,290 --> 00:06:09,290
[I sincerely beg for a ticket.
Willing to add 400 to the base price.]

101
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:07,450
I sincerely beg for a ticket.
Willing to add 400 to the base price...

102
00:06:09,340 --> 00:06:11,930
[I sincerely beg for a ticket.
Willing to add 800 to the base price.]

103
00:06:10,220 --> 00:06:11,010
800.

104
00:06:12,030 --> 00:06:16,850
[Han Geng fans group chat]

105
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,330
[I didn't get one too.]

106
00:06:18,350 --> 00:06:19,840
[Same here. Also looking to tickets.]

107
00:06:19,860 --> 00:06:21,810
[Cries—I've got no tickets too.]

108
00:06:21,890 --> 00:06:22,860
[Wang Dao 888]

109
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:26,530
[I know someone.]

110
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,250
The deposit is here.

111
00:06:53,950 --> 00:06:54,830
Angel's Tears!

112
00:06:58,070 --> 00:06:59,310
Did you just

113
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,320
meet another online friend?

114
00:07:02,070 --> 00:07:04,000
What's this online friend's name?

115
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:06,040
Em0b01?

116
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:09,190
I'm in a good mood today,

117
00:07:09,190 --> 00:07:10,590
so I won't argue with you.

118
00:07:11,270 --> 00:07:12,470
What's the good news?

119
00:07:15,870 --> 00:07:17,190
I got the tickets!

120
00:07:18,950 --> 00:07:20,600
I'm deaf now, Sis.

121
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,560
No way.

122
00:07:22,630 --> 00:07:24,160
How did you get the tickets?

123
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:26,420
There's a trick to chasing stars.

124
00:07:26,430 --> 00:07:27,680
Did you see that guy just now?

125
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,870
That was Qian.

126
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:30,920
Who's that?

127
00:07:31,270 --> 00:07:33,190
Han Geng's cousin.

128
00:07:33,310 --> 00:07:34,070
He's from Mudanjiang.

129
00:07:34,070 --> 00:07:35,190
A real insider.

130
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,680
Didn't you notice his eyes

131
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:38,750
and his nose

132
00:07:38,750 --> 00:07:40,409
look exactly like Han Geng's?

133
00:07:41,510 --> 00:07:43,040
Han Geng's cousin?

134
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:45,310
Why would he be in our city?

135
00:07:45,870 --> 00:07:47,510
Every time Han Geng has a concert,

136
00:07:47,510 --> 00:07:49,680
his team would go
in advance for promotion.

137
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,480
And then,

138
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:52,560
they release some internal tickets
to hardcore fans.

139
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:54,159
They're all the best seats.

140
00:07:54,430 --> 00:07:55,800
Pay half as a deposit first,

141
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,270
and when you get the ticket at the venue,

142
00:07:57,270 --> 00:07:58,530
you pay the other half.

143
00:07:58,950 --> 00:07:59,950
This way,

144
00:07:59,950 --> 00:08:02,510
it's hundreds cheaper
than a scalper ticket.

145
00:08:04,750 --> 00:08:07,480
This sounds exactly like a scalper.

146
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,750
It's too professional,

147
00:08:11,750 --> 00:08:13,800
you wouldn't understand
even if I explained it.

148
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,190
What a waste of my time.

149
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,430
I got the tickets!

150
00:08:35,010 --> 00:08:36,200
That was Qian.

151
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:40,080
Han Geng's cousin.

152
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,670
Pay a part of the deposit first,

153
00:08:46,670 --> 00:08:47,960
and when you get the ticket at the venue,

154
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,270
you pay the other half.

155
00:08:50,270 --> 00:08:52,800
It's hundreds cheaper
than a scalper ticket.

156
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:58,840
This isn't right.

157
00:08:59,870 --> 00:09:02,730
There's definitely something wrong
with that guy.

158
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:24,440
Mom?

159
00:09:25,100 --> 00:09:25,500
Dad?

160
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:50,130
[Duan Qiyan is prohibited from using this]

161
00:09:57,270 --> 00:10:00,050
[Han Geng]

162
00:10:07,260 --> 00:10:08,870
[Attention:
girls who are going to the concert.]

163
00:10:08,900 --> 00:10:10,000
[There's been a scammer going around
scamming fans.]

164
00:10:11,950 --> 00:10:13,580
[Han Geng Forum]

165
00:10:13,660 --> 00:10:15,580
[I heard people bought fake tickets.
This person target fans.]

166
00:10:19,930 --> 00:10:21,820
[Someone took a photo of the scammer.]

167
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,320
I can't even...

168
00:10:22,550 --> 00:10:24,720
tell how this person looks like.

169
00:10:27,060 --> 00:10:28,310
[Han Geng scalper tickets]

170
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:28,720
[Han Geng wanted to do a special concert,]

171
00:10:28,750 --> 00:10:29,260
[yet scalpers drive the prices up.]

172
00:10:33,590 --> 00:10:34,600
[Where is Han Geng from?]

173
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,880
[Does Han Geng have a cousin?]

174
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:43,390
Jeez!

175
00:10:45,670 --> 00:10:46,480
Sorry.

176
00:10:46,650 --> 00:10:49,380
The number you dialed is out of service.
Sorry...

177
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:53,270
She has money for a concert
but not for her phone bill.

178
00:10:53,270 --> 00:10:54,510
Seriously...

179
00:10:58,270 --> 00:10:59,030
Ma'am.

180
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,790
Is Tingting home?

181
00:11:00,790 --> 00:11:02,150
She went to her grandmother's house.

182
00:11:02,150 --> 00:11:04,950
Said she wanted to eat
her grandmother's cooking.

183
00:11:05,910 --> 00:11:07,510
To her grandmother's house?

184
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,200
Duan.

185
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,820
Why are you looking for Tingting?

186
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:16,200
Nothing, Ma'am.

187
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,880
I was going to ask her a math question.

188
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:18,840
If she's not here, never mind.

189
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,030
I'll get going.

190
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:20,600
Bye-bye.

191
00:11:20,750 --> 00:11:21,280
Bye-bye.

192
00:11:22,910 --> 00:11:25,110
Are you sure Tang Tingting got scammed?

193
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,240
Of course.

194
00:11:26,390 --> 00:11:27,840
Although I'm not 100% sure,

195
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:29,080
my intuition tells me

196
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:31,480
there's definitely something wrong
with that guy.

197
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,470
Why?

198
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:35,670
Paying a deposit
before getting the ticket—

199
00:11:35,670 --> 00:11:37,120
it's most likely a scam.

200
00:11:37,550 --> 00:11:38,360
Besides,

201
00:11:39,030 --> 00:11:42,030
I found a very important piece
of evidence!

202
00:11:51,770 --> 00:11:54,440
Han Geng doesn't have a cousin!

203
00:12:03,550 --> 00:12:05,630
Tang Tingting told me

204
00:12:06,140 --> 00:12:08,150
that the scalper is Han Geng's cousin.

205
00:12:08,150 --> 00:12:09,010
So I went online

206
00:12:09,010 --> 00:12:10,130
and searched for a whole morning.

207
00:12:10,130 --> 00:12:12,060
But Han Geng doesn't have a cousin!

208
00:12:14,100 --> 00:12:15,050
You searched online for the whole morning?

209
00:12:15,050 --> 00:12:15,860
All morning.

210
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:18,120
No matter what,

211
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:19,530
we have to find him.

212
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:21,690
What if something bad happens?

213
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,040
But how do we find her?

214
00:12:23,270 --> 00:12:26,070
We don't even know
where she went to get the ticket.

215
00:12:29,510 --> 00:12:30,510
I have a idea.

216
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:33,000
But I need your help.

217
00:12:41,570 --> 00:12:44,690
[No use of Duan Qiyan]

218
00:12:45,510 --> 00:12:46,320
Let's do this.

219
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:58,000
Don't panic.

220
00:12:58,080 --> 00:12:59,480
Let's do this one by one.

221
00:13:00,150 --> 00:13:01,880
Actually, this is very simple.

222
00:13:02,510 --> 00:13:04,440
Since we can't find Tang Tingting,

223
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:06,270
we go directly to Qian.

224
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:08,480
The local fan group chat must have clues.

225
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:09,440
We can just sneak in

226
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:10,500
and take a look.

227
00:13:18,930 --> 00:13:20,950
[Would you like to join "Geng Babes"
as "Death Scythe"?]

228
00:13:23,690 --> 00:13:24,790
[The moderator
has rejected your application.]

229
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:29,760
Heh...

230
00:13:30,820 --> 00:13:32,270
Local fan group chats like this

231
00:13:32,270 --> 00:13:34,100
usually only admit hardcore fans.

232
00:13:34,100 --> 00:13:36,250
With a profile picture of Kobe

233
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:38,440
and a username like "Death Scythe,"

234
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:40,370
you're obviously not a fan.

235
00:13:41,270 --> 00:13:41,980
Let me do it.

236
00:13:48,030 --> 00:13:49,260
[Personal information:
One & Only Geng]

237
00:13:51,630 --> 00:13:52,360
This is good.

238
00:13:52,430 --> 00:13:53,630
[The moderator
has approved your application.]

239
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:54,670
You're in!

240
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:57,220
That's amazing, Shen.

241
00:13:59,730 --> 00:14:00,010
[Geng Babes]

242
00:14:00,090 --> 00:14:01,740
[Genggeng Forever
invites you to "Geng Babes'" voice call]

243
00:14:01,740 --> 00:14:04,220
[Please answer the voice call.
I'll give you the test right now.]

244
00:14:02,010 --> 00:14:02,790
Please answer the voice call.

245
00:14:02,790 --> 00:14:04,590
I'll give you the test right now.

246
00:14:04,910 --> 00:14:05,550
Here.

247
00:14:05,550 --> 00:14:06,870
Voice test?

248
00:14:09,550 --> 00:14:10,240
Hello?

249
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:13,360
I'm a moderator, Genggeng Forever.

250
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:15,910
We will now test you
for the group chat admission.

251
00:14:15,910 --> 00:14:17,570
What is Han Geng's debut date?

252
00:14:22,010 --> 00:14:22,670
Do you know?

253
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:24,630
[Please answer the voice call.
I'll give you the test right now.]

254
00:14:24,710 --> 00:14:25,790
[You've been kicked out
of the group chat by the moderator.]

255
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:29,010
Well, Shen,

256
00:14:29,670 --> 00:14:31,000
you're not a fan either.

257
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,130
Duan Qiyan, you type fast.

258
00:14:33,130 --> 00:14:34,440
I'll take the call later.

259
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:36,000
You just search for the answer online.

260
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:36,670
Okay.

261
00:14:40,180 --> 00:14:40,620
[Geng Babes]

262
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:42,020
[Genggeng Forever]

263
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:42,720
Hello.

264
00:14:42,870 --> 00:14:46,120
I'm Hearts4Geng.

265
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:48,220
We will now conduct
the group admission test.

266
00:14:47,490 --> 00:14:48,530
[One & Only Geng] [Genggeng Forever]

267
00:14:48,370 --> 00:14:49,900
What is Han Geng's fan song?

268
00:14:50,870 --> 00:14:51,520
[Han Geng's fan song]

269
00:14:53,860 --> 00:14:55,170
[Han Geng's fan song]

270
00:14:54,460 --> 00:14:55,390
"Wings of Love."

271
00:14:56,220 --> 00:14:56,820
Very good.

272
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:59,980
Which year
did Han Geng have a hellish schedule?

273
00:15:00,370 --> 00:15:01,450
[Han Geng hellish schedule]

274
00:15:01,790 --> 00:15:02,580
2009.

275
00:15:02,790 --> 00:15:04,240
Okay, the last question.

276
00:15:04,410 --> 00:15:05,870
Please listen carefully.

277
00:15:08,680 --> 00:15:10,510
[One & Only Geng] [Genggeng Forever]

278
00:15:17,150 --> 00:15:18,630
Please name this song.

279
00:15:20,100 --> 00:15:20,820
I...

280
00:15:22,490 --> 00:15:23,580
[One & Only Geng] [Genggeng Forever]

281
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,000
Do you know?

282
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:27,010
I don't.

283
00:15:27,150 --> 00:15:27,270
[One & Only Geng] [Genggeng Forever]

284
00:15:27,270 --> 00:15:27,760
[Please answer the voice call.
I'll give you the test right now.]

285
00:15:27,760 --> 00:15:28,490
[You've been kicked out
of the group chat by the moderator.]

286
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:38,240
What should we do?

287
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:40,420
Han Geng has over a dozen songs so far.

288
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:41,840
Who could figure out the song

289
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:44,100
just by listening to it for a few seconds?

290
00:16:10,100 --> 00:16:12,960
Memorizing the intros
to over a dozen songs in a short time

291
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:14,740
is an impossible task for someone like me

292
00:16:14,740 --> 00:16:16,170
who can't sing.

293
00:16:17,220 --> 00:16:18,370
But memorizing images

294
00:16:18,370 --> 00:16:19,630
is a piece of cake to me.

295
00:16:20,340 --> 00:16:22,150
I can give this method a try.

296
00:16:28,850 --> 00:16:29,970
[Han Geng-"The Moth Rushes Toward Fire"]

297
00:16:30,270 --> 00:16:31,820
"The Moth Rushes Toward Fire."

298
00:16:31,820 --> 00:16:32,750
That's correct.

299
00:16:34,980 --> 00:16:36,210
[Baby Genggeng] [Genggeng Forever]

300
00:16:36,390 --> 00:16:37,190
"Separated."

301
00:16:37,500 --> 00:16:38,430
That's correct.

302
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:42,640
The last song.

303
00:16:42,860 --> 00:16:44,270
[Baby Genggeng] [Genggeng Forever]

304
00:16:45,510 --> 00:16:46,600
"Life is But a Dream."

305
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:47,530
That's correct.

306
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:51,240
Welcome to the Geng Babes family.

307
00:16:49,250 --> 00:16:50,420
[Baby Genggeng] [Genggeng Forever]

308
00:16:56,460 --> 00:16:57,530
Does anyone know Qian?

309
00:16:56,500 --> 00:16:57,550
[Welcome to the Geng Babes family.]

310
00:16:58,580 --> 00:16:59,820
Tell them you want to buy tickets too.

311
00:16:59,820 --> 00:17:00,820
Yes, say you're looking for a ticket.

312
00:16:59,870 --> 00:17:01,500
[Does anyone know Qian?]

313
00:17:01,240 --> 00:17:02,150
I'm looking for a ticket.

314
00:17:01,500 --> 00:17:02,270
[I'm looking for a ticket.]

315
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:09,109
Let's see how he replies.

316
00:17:09,109 --> 00:17:10,200
He's distributing tickets

317
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:12,680
at the small gate on the west side
of the venue at 4:30 PM today.

318
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:13,609
-Got it.
-Got it.

319
00:17:14,589 --> 00:17:15,440
Let's go. What are you waiting for?

320
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:15,720
Go!

321
00:17:15,740 --> 00:17:16,940
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

322
00:17:26,069 --> 00:17:26,880
Jiang Yubai.

323
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:29,000
Do you want to switch seats?

324
00:17:29,110 --> 00:17:31,350
Isn't it too crowded for you 3 guys?

325
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:37,640
Sure—

326
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:38,440
Nope.

327
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:43,400
I-I-I really like sitting in the middle.

328
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:45,160
The middle has a wide view—it's great.

329
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:46,790
And it feels snug.

330
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:47,940
Very comfortable.

331
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:49,480
What?

332
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:51,520
It feels snug.

333
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:52,350
Is that so?

334
00:17:52,350 --> 00:17:53,000
Yeah.

335
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:55,310
It's a bit too squeezy
on my side right now.

336
00:17:55,310 --> 00:17:56,400
That's too snug.

337
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:57,330
That's too much.

338
00:17:57,440 --> 00:17:58,240
Shen!

339
00:17:58,790 --> 00:17:59,720
Stop squeezing.

340
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:00,960
L-Let's set off.

341
00:18:01,460 --> 00:18:01,990
Let's go.

342
00:18:02,010 --> 00:18:02,540
Let's go.

343
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:24,420
Duan Qiyan, wait up!

344
00:18:27,030 --> 00:18:27,830
Tang.

345
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:29,030
Sorry.

346
00:18:33,220 --> 00:18:33,880
Sorry.

347
00:18:37,350 --> 00:18:38,550
Tang! Tang!

348
00:18:38,830 --> 00:18:40,490
Sorry, I got the wrong person.

349
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:50,400
Duan Qiyan, why are you here?

350
00:18:53,790 --> 00:18:54,750
Your phone is out of credit.

351
00:18:54,750 --> 00:18:56,400
Couldn't you have topped it up?

352
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:57,200
Really?

353
00:18:57,790 --> 00:18:59,310
What were you calling me for?

354
00:18:59,310 --> 00:19:00,910
Something's up, obviously.

355
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:03,250
Duan Qiyan, why did you run off so quickly?

356
00:19:04,350 --> 00:19:05,510
Why are you all here?

357
00:19:06,350 --> 00:19:07,410
You got the ticket?

358
00:19:09,510 --> 00:19:11,370
But... But where's that scammer?

359
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:13,140
The guy who you met yesterday?

360
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:14,960
I'll tell you again.

361
00:19:14,960 --> 00:19:16,730
He's not a swindler. He's Qian.

362
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:18,030
He was just here.

363
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:19,360
He gave me the ticket.

364
00:19:20,550 --> 00:19:21,480
Can I have a look?

365
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:27,720
First row?

366
00:19:29,550 --> 00:19:31,410
Is this Qian really that amazing?

367
00:19:34,010 --> 00:19:34,490
[Beyond the Prologue 2010]

368
00:19:34,520 --> 00:19:35,960
[World Tour—Nanhai Stop]

369
00:19:36,180 --> 00:19:36,850
[Beyond the Prologue World Tour—Nanhai Stop]

370
00:19:39,110 --> 00:19:40,000
Wait.

371
00:19:40,720 --> 00:19:42,520
The English word for "Stadium"—

372
00:19:44,350 --> 00:19:46,070
it's typed as "Stadiam."

373
00:19:49,420 --> 00:19:52,220
Would official tickets
make this kind of mistake?

374
00:20:00,590 --> 00:20:01,400
Impossible.

375
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:02,440
Scan it again.

376
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:04,070
My ticket can't be fake.

377
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:07,310
Young girl, your ticket is obviously fake.

378
00:20:07,790 --> 00:20:10,850
Real tickets have official watermarks
and holo marks.

379
00:20:11,160 --> 00:20:12,920
Plus, in this section,

380
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:14,520
there is no such seat number.

381
00:20:15,110 --> 00:20:18,200
Are you sure you bought it
through an official platform?

382
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:20,270
I bought it from a friend.

383
00:20:20,790 --> 00:20:22,240
He's Han Geng's cousin.

384
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:23,720
He promised it was real.

385
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:24,640
Cousin?

386
00:20:24,830 --> 00:20:26,560
Yeah right, Han Geng's cousin.

387
00:20:26,590 --> 00:20:27,510
Duan Qiyan!

388
00:20:27,960 --> 00:20:28,790
Stop talking.

389
00:20:37,680 --> 00:20:38,750
Didn't I tell you?

390
00:20:38,750 --> 00:20:40,610
That guy was obviously a scammer.

391
00:20:40,790 --> 00:20:41,920
Tang Tingting, how old are you?

392
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:42,880
You keep falling for this,

393
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:44,010
over and over again.

394
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:46,110
Look around now.

395
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:47,400
There is not a single soul here.

396
00:20:47,400 --> 00:20:48,160
Where are you going to catch him?

397
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:49,000
He ran away long ago.

398
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:50,720
Can you just shut up?

399
00:20:51,200 --> 00:20:53,550
I saved up for half a year just for this.

400
00:20:54,350 --> 00:20:55,310
Mind your own business.

401
00:20:55,310 --> 00:20:56,640
So what if I got scammed?

402
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:01,550
Hey...

403
00:21:03,160 --> 00:21:04,110
Don't cry.

404
00:21:04,110 --> 00:21:05,510
I was wrong, okay?

405
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:09,040
I'm just worried about you
and am doing this for your own good.

406
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:16,000
All right, as long as you're okay.

407
00:21:16,590 --> 00:21:17,400
Yeah.

408
00:21:18,680 --> 00:21:19,480
Let's go.

409
00:21:19,550 --> 00:21:20,720
Let's go home.

410
00:21:20,880 --> 00:21:22,680
I'll just consider it
a lesson learned with money.

411
00:21:22,680 --> 00:21:23,510
No.

412
00:21:24,440 --> 00:21:25,750
You didn't do anything wrong.

413
00:21:25,750 --> 00:21:27,750
Why should you pay to learn a lesson?

414
00:21:31,160 --> 00:21:32,020
Tang Tingting.

415
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,600
Give me Qian's phone number.

416
00:22:13,350 --> 00:22:13,750
Hello?

417
00:22:13,810 --> 00:22:14,340
Who is it?

418
00:22:14,880 --> 00:22:16,330
Hello, is this Qian?

419
00:22:16,920 --> 00:22:18,850
Do you still have concert tickets?

420
00:22:19,160 --> 00:22:19,550
Yes.

421
00:22:20,480 --> 00:22:21,720
I need them urgently.

422
00:22:21,930 --> 00:22:23,590
I'll pay whatever extra you want.

423
00:22:23,590 --> 00:22:24,720
How many do you need?

424
00:22:25,050 --> 00:22:25,680
How many?

425
00:22:27,850 --> 00:22:29,500
Two. Including me.

426
00:22:29,810 --> 00:22:30,870
I'm her boyfriend.

427
00:22:33,790 --> 00:22:34,120
Sure.

428
00:22:35,070 --> 00:22:36,400
But it's about to start.

429
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:37,660
You have to pay extra.

430
00:22:37,660 --> 00:22:38,610
880 a ticket.

431
00:22:39,180 --> 00:22:40,980
Plus the fee for adjacent seats.

432
00:22:41,460 --> 00:22:42,500
That'd be 2,200.

433
00:22:43,340 --> 00:22:44,480
Sure, no problem.

434
00:22:44,750 --> 00:22:45,950
Where should we meet?

435
00:22:47,180 --> 00:22:48,530
The milk tea shop
on the west street of the stadium.

436
00:22:48,530 --> 00:22:49,590
You know it, right?

437
00:22:49,900 --> 00:22:50,750
Let's meet there.

438
00:22:50,750 --> 00:22:51,550
In 20 minutes.

439
00:22:52,030 --> 00:22:53,140
I'll wait for you on the 1st floor.

440
00:22:53,140 --> 00:22:53,960
Be quick.

441
00:22:54,110 --> 00:22:56,400
There won't be tickets left
if you're late.

442
00:22:56,400 --> 00:22:57,930
Okay, we'll be right there.

443
00:23:00,720 --> 00:23:01,510
Jiang Yubai.

444
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:04,380
Why did you suddenly
add a role for yourself?

445
00:23:05,480 --> 00:23:08,210
Are you comfortable
letting Lin Zhixia go alone?

446
00:23:09,640 --> 00:23:11,750
Let's go. We only have 20 minutes.

447
00:23:12,330 --> 00:23:13,390
Who brought money?

448
00:23:13,920 --> 00:23:16,310
Zhixia, who goes out with 2,200?

449
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:19,790
Just in case.

450
00:23:20,070 --> 00:23:21,800
I happen to have brought money.

451
00:23:35,110 --> 00:23:36,200
Are you Qian?

452
00:23:38,830 --> 00:23:40,230
I would like the tickets.

453
00:23:42,030 --> 00:23:43,430
Who is this handsome guy?

454
00:23:47,200 --> 00:23:48,310
I'm her boyfriend.

455
00:23:50,920 --> 00:23:52,250
Did you bring the money?

456
00:23:57,330 --> 00:23:58,590
You're too late.

457
00:23:58,590 --> 00:24:00,200
The ticket check is about to start.

458
00:24:00,200 --> 00:24:01,920
Here, hurry up.

459
00:24:03,790 --> 00:24:05,310
Aren't you going to check the amount?

460
00:24:05,310 --> 00:24:07,510
No need. Your show is about to start.

461
00:24:07,510 --> 00:24:09,040
Hurry up. Don't waste time.

462
00:24:09,400 --> 00:24:10,200
Hold on.

463
00:24:11,310 --> 00:24:13,710
Count the money carefully before leaving.

464
00:24:22,920 --> 00:24:24,310
Fine, I'll count it.

465
00:24:25,350 --> 00:24:26,510
Let me count it.

466
00:24:26,680 --> 00:24:29,200
All right. Let me see.

467
00:24:33,240 --> 00:24:33,970
Are you okay?

468
00:24:38,550 --> 00:24:39,350
Trying to run, huh?

469
00:24:39,350 --> 00:24:40,110
I won't run!

470
00:24:40,160 --> 00:24:42,240
I won't run. I won't run.

471
00:24:43,070 --> 00:24:44,030
Ouch, ouch.

472
00:24:44,030 --> 00:24:45,160
The police are here!

473
00:24:45,510 --> 00:24:46,020
The police are here.

474
00:24:46,020 --> 00:24:47,050
The police are here.

475
00:24:47,050 --> 00:24:48,180
The police are here.

476
00:24:48,180 --> 00:24:48,920
Officer!

477
00:24:49,640 --> 00:24:51,700
It's him. He's selling fake tickets.

478
00:24:52,590 --> 00:24:55,200
Officer, this is nonsense.

479
00:24:55,350 --> 00:24:56,350
Tell me—

480
00:24:56,480 --> 00:24:58,640
where do I even have a single ticket?

481
00:24:58,920 --> 00:25:00,550
I don't have any tickets on me.

482
00:25:00,550 --> 00:25:02,200
On what basis do you say
I'm selling fake tickets?

483
00:25:02,200 --> 00:25:03,400
Stop lying.

484
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:05,480
You're the head fan
they mentioned on the forum.

485
00:25:05,480 --> 00:25:06,270
It's him.

486
00:25:06,270 --> 00:25:07,720
He swore he would have tickets.

487
00:25:07,720 --> 00:25:08,960
But he just scammed me.

488
00:25:08,960 --> 00:25:09,830
Listen, miss.

489
00:25:10,270 --> 00:25:11,480
In this internet age,

490
00:25:11,640 --> 00:25:13,510
you can't even tell
if you're talking to a person

491
00:25:13,510 --> 00:25:14,790
or a machine online.

492
00:25:14,790 --> 00:25:16,110
Why do you say it was me?

493
00:25:16,110 --> 00:25:17,110
Do you have proof?

494
00:25:19,830 --> 00:25:21,680
If you didn't sell us fake tickets,

495
00:25:21,680 --> 00:25:23,380
then why do you have our money?

496
00:25:25,030 --> 00:25:26,640
This is even more ridiculous.

497
00:25:26,640 --> 00:25:27,370
She's saying

498
00:25:27,640 --> 00:25:28,840
that my money is hers.

499
00:25:29,440 --> 00:25:29,940
What?

500
00:25:30,310 --> 00:25:31,070
If you call out to it,

501
00:25:31,070 --> 00:25:32,130
will it answer you?

502
00:25:33,350 --> 00:25:34,290
I can.

503
00:25:39,920 --> 00:25:42,400
RE72591436.

504
00:25:42,720 --> 00:25:45,000
RT68604243.

505
00:25:45,400 --> 00:25:47,830
QM59284713.

506
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:50,380
To prove that Qian is indeed suspicious,

507
00:25:50,380 --> 00:25:53,310
we had to memorize
the serial numbers on these bills.

508
00:25:53,350 --> 00:25:56,160
You memorized all of them
in such a short time?

509
00:25:56,790 --> 00:25:57,990
Don't we have phones?

510
00:25:58,070 --> 00:25:59,330
We just took pictures.

511
00:26:00,750 --> 00:26:02,900
CT12377756.

512
00:26:03,380 --> 00:26:06,140
AB74255931.

513
00:26:06,570 --> 00:26:09,160
EM08351742.

514
00:26:09,790 --> 00:26:12,460
XY14709265.

515
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:17,640
All correct.

516
00:26:18,140 --> 00:26:20,880
Didn't you just glance at them
when taking the pictures?

517
00:26:20,880 --> 00:26:22,610
And I just memorized them then.

518
00:26:23,440 --> 00:26:25,270
To prevent getting scammed,

519
00:26:25,270 --> 00:26:27,480
we specifically memorized them
before buying the tickets.

520
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:28,880
Of course, we will need the officers

521
00:26:28,880 --> 00:26:30,480
to verify who they belong to.

522
00:26:31,310 --> 00:26:34,030
But once it's verified
that the money is indeed ours,

523
00:26:34,030 --> 00:26:35,960
even if you don't admit
to selling us fake tickets,

524
00:26:35,960 --> 00:26:37,000
you'll still have to explain

525
00:26:37,000 --> 00:26:39,160
why our money is with you.

526
00:26:40,070 --> 00:26:41,350
If you can't explain it...

527
00:26:41,350 --> 00:26:42,750
We can reasonably suspect

528
00:26:42,750 --> 00:26:44,210
that you committed theft.

529
00:26:44,240 --> 00:26:44,780
Hey.

530
00:26:44,810 --> 00:26:46,030
Fraud or theft—

531
00:26:46,310 --> 00:26:47,160
pick one.

532
00:26:47,940 --> 00:26:48,270
They...

533
00:26:48,270 --> 00:26:48,750
Bro.

534
00:26:49,640 --> 00:26:51,440
You thought hiding would keep you safe,

535
00:26:51,440 --> 00:26:54,300
but you didn't expect us
to have the smartest brain.

536
00:26:58,350 --> 00:26:59,790
Doing a good deed a day

537
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:02,550
will keep the moonlight bright at night.

538
00:27:02,960 --> 00:27:03,750
Tang,

539
00:27:03,960 --> 00:27:06,030
I didn't expect you to do a good deed.

540
00:27:06,110 --> 00:27:07,610
The police said

541
00:27:07,830 --> 00:27:09,480
that he is an experienced scammer.

542
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:11,680
He's not one to admit
to selling fake tickets.

543
00:27:11,680 --> 00:27:13,640
This is thanks to you, Zhixia.

544
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:15,040
How did you think of that?

545
00:27:15,790 --> 00:27:16,790
I just felt

546
00:27:16,790 --> 00:27:18,880
that the reason he used cash

547
00:27:19,110 --> 00:27:20,960
must be because
he was afraid of being traced.

548
00:27:20,960 --> 00:27:22,160
Since when making the deal,

549
00:27:22,160 --> 00:27:23,510
he had no witnesses or evidence,

550
00:27:23,510 --> 00:27:26,030
we'd have to create witnesses
and evidence for him.

551
00:27:26,030 --> 00:27:27,960
Anyway, our money is with him.

552
00:27:28,270 --> 00:27:30,470
He has to admit to either theft or fraud.

553
00:27:32,350 --> 00:27:33,680
We're also lucky today.

554
00:27:33,830 --> 00:27:35,200
If the scalper wasn't greedy,

555
00:27:35,200 --> 00:27:36,200
he wouldn't have come back.

556
00:27:36,200 --> 00:27:36,830
Right.

557
00:27:37,550 --> 00:27:39,720
Fortunately,
apart from missing the concert,

558
00:27:39,720 --> 00:27:41,120
we didn't lose anything.

559
00:27:43,350 --> 00:27:45,590
I just want to see a concert.

560
00:27:46,070 --> 00:27:47,800
What use do I have for the money?

561
00:27:48,160 --> 00:27:49,680
And Han Geng is here only for one concert

562
00:27:49,680 --> 00:27:51,030
this year.

563
00:27:52,750 --> 00:27:55,000
Why is it so hard to watch a concert?

564
00:27:58,030 --> 00:27:59,350
If you want to watch the concert,

565
00:27:59,350 --> 00:28:00,550
it's not impossible.

566
00:28:02,480 --> 00:28:03,980
When we walked over just now,

567
00:28:03,980 --> 00:28:04,890
I noticed that

568
00:28:04,920 --> 00:28:07,520
the acoustics
in each area are a bit different.

569
00:28:07,680 --> 00:28:10,070
Looking at the structure of this venue,

570
00:28:10,290 --> 00:28:12,820
there must be a place
with the best acoustics.

571
00:28:14,290 --> 00:28:15,220
Let's go find it.

572
00:28:20,980 --> 00:28:22,910
That was my first time at a concert.

573
00:28:24,180 --> 00:28:25,640
Even though before today,

574
00:28:26,070 --> 00:28:28,400
I didn't even know who was singing inside.

575
00:28:30,090 --> 00:28:32,650
But now, as soon as I hear the intro,

576
00:28:33,400 --> 00:28:34,880
I know the name of the song.

577
00:28:37,700 --> 00:28:38,850
I know the propagation characteristics

578
00:28:38,850 --> 00:28:41,180
of high-frequency
and low-frequency sound waves.

579
00:28:41,180 --> 00:28:42,700
I also took Tang Tingting and the others

580
00:28:42,700 --> 00:28:45,430
to find the spot outside
with the best acoustics.

581
00:28:48,380 --> 00:28:50,580
There were people waving light sticks,

582
00:28:50,920 --> 00:28:53,050
instantly lighting up a sea of lights.

583
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:55,420
We hummed songs out of tune

584
00:28:55,810 --> 00:28:56,940
and danced stiffly.

585
00:28:57,900 --> 00:29:00,550
I can't remember
the muffled singing inside,

586
00:29:01,700 --> 00:29:03,230
but my memory of the concert

587
00:29:03,810 --> 00:29:07,110
is paused at the starry sky
we lit up for ourselves

588
00:29:07,850 --> 00:29:10,250
with flashlights and out-of-tune voices.

589
00:29:15,750 --> 00:29:18,640
Our Han Geng is so handsome.

590
00:29:20,200 --> 00:29:22,960
Did you see Han Geng in person today?

591
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:23,790
Mind your own business.

592
00:29:23,790 --> 00:29:26,320
Han Geng is just handsome.
The most handsome.

593
00:29:26,790 --> 00:29:27,850
Right, Duan Qiyan?

594
00:29:28,640 --> 00:29:30,750
Yes, Han Geng is handsome.

595
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:37,600
What are you thinking about?

596
00:29:39,110 --> 00:29:40,170
I'm thinking about

597
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:42,240
how I gained a new experience today.

598
00:29:42,590 --> 00:29:44,160
It's my first time at a concert,

599
00:29:44,160 --> 00:29:45,880
and it was with you too.

600
00:29:48,550 --> 00:29:50,070
I realize a lot of my firsts

601
00:29:50,070 --> 00:29:51,350
are with you.

602
00:29:52,110 --> 00:29:53,910
My first time having a deskmate.

603
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:56,680
My first time
receiving a birthday present.

604
00:29:56,680 --> 00:29:58,610
My first time going to an aquarium.

605
00:30:00,030 --> 00:30:00,830
Then,

606
00:30:01,610 --> 00:30:03,670
is there anything else you want to do?

607
00:30:08,260 --> 00:30:10,790
I hope that
when I go to Mars for the first time,

608
00:30:10,830 --> 00:30:12,400
you can be by my side too.

609
00:30:17,680 --> 00:30:18,480
Do you want some?

610
00:30:18,480 --> 00:30:19,880
No, I'm too full.

611
00:30:20,590 --> 00:30:21,310
Shen.

612
00:30:22,160 --> 00:30:22,830
Shen!

613
00:30:24,160 --> 00:30:25,090
Do you want some?

614
00:30:26,350 --> 00:30:27,070
Thanks.

615
00:30:27,070 --> 00:30:29,850
I want to go... to the National Museum,

616
00:30:30,200 --> 00:30:31,240
the Louvre,

617
00:30:31,900 --> 00:30:33,090
an amusement park,

618
00:30:33,290 --> 00:30:33,850
a water park—

619
00:30:33,850 --> 00:30:34,900
This can be done.

620
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:38,030
Let's go to the amusement park tomorrow.

621
00:30:38,030 --> 00:30:38,510
Sure!

622
00:30:40,030 --> 00:30:41,690
Amusement park? Sounds good.

623
00:30:42,350 --> 00:30:43,680
-Hey, I'm not...
-Didn't you ask

624
00:30:43,680 --> 00:30:46,050
if we want to go
to the amusement park tomorrow?

625
00:30:46,050 --> 00:30:46,850
I meant...

626
00:30:46,900 --> 00:30:48,700
Hey, Duan Qiyan, Tang Tingting.

627
00:30:48,920 --> 00:30:50,680
Jiang Yubai is asking if we want to go
to the amusement park tomorrow.

628
00:30:50,680 --> 00:30:51,480
-Sure!
-Sure!

629
00:30:51,550 --> 00:30:52,240
Tell you what,

630
00:30:52,240 --> 00:30:54,000
it's my treat. To thank you guys.

631
00:30:54,000 --> 00:30:54,640
Sure!

632
00:31:18,000 --> 00:31:22,150
[Fantasy Kingdom]

633
00:31:19,920 --> 00:31:22,070
Friends, let's be the first ones in!

634
00:31:22,510 --> 00:31:23,550
I'm so sleepy.

635
00:31:23,680 --> 00:31:26,160
We have a really intense schedule
this weekend.

636
00:31:26,160 --> 00:31:27,400
I made a plan last night.

637
00:31:27,400 --> 00:31:28,510
We must complete

638
00:31:28,510 --> 00:31:30,400
every single ride today.

639
00:31:31,240 --> 00:31:32,700
Thank you, Tang Tingting.

640
00:31:32,880 --> 00:31:33,880
My parents are busy with work,

641
00:31:33,880 --> 00:31:35,270
so they never brought me here.

642
00:31:35,270 --> 00:31:36,350
It's no big deal.

643
00:31:36,510 --> 00:31:39,440
Of course you come to an amusement park
with friends.

644
00:31:39,440 --> 00:31:40,110
Let's go.

645
00:31:40,420 --> 00:31:40,830
Let's go.

646
00:31:40,830 --> 00:31:41,360
Let's go.

647
00:31:42,170 --> 00:31:43,890
[Fantasy Kingdom]

648
00:31:45,240 --> 00:31:45,980
Hello!

649
00:31:46,310 --> 00:31:47,310
Are you students?

650
00:31:47,380 --> 00:31:48,030
Yes.

651
00:31:48,400 --> 00:31:50,590
Our amusement park
recently launched a new event.

652
00:31:50,500 --> 00:31:52,700
[Mission Box]

653
00:31:50,960 --> 00:31:51,750
It's called the Mission Card event.

654
00:31:51,750 --> 00:31:53,050
Would you like to have a try?

655
00:31:53,050 --> 00:31:54,590
What is it about?

656
00:31:54,720 --> 00:31:55,500
Here's how it works:

657
00:31:55,500 --> 00:31:57,030
when you enter the park later,

658
00:31:55,880 --> 00:31:56,690
[Mission Box]

659
00:31:57,030 --> 00:31:57,880
everyone will wear

660
00:31:57,880 --> 00:31:59,570
a badge like this on their chest.

661
00:31:59,570 --> 00:32:00,970
[Mission Box]

662
00:31:59,640 --> 00:32:00,790
Then from my box,

663
00:32:00,790 --> 00:32:02,680
you'll draw your hidden missions.

664
00:32:02,680 --> 00:32:04,770
You have to complete this mission

665
00:32:04,770 --> 00:32:06,110
avoiding getting caught by others.

666
00:32:06,110 --> 00:32:07,640
Once someone successfully calls you out,

667
00:32:07,640 --> 00:32:08,750
your mission fails,

668
00:32:08,750 --> 00:32:10,850
and this badge will go to them.

669
00:32:11,000 --> 00:32:12,400
When you leave the park,

670
00:32:12,510 --> 00:32:14,240
whoever has the most badges

671
00:32:13,420 --> 00:32:15,500
[Mission Box]

672
00:32:14,380 --> 00:32:15,440
will be the winner.

673
00:32:17,480 --> 00:32:19,200
That sounds quite interesting.

674
00:32:19,200 --> 00:32:19,720
Yeah.

675
00:32:19,720 --> 00:32:21,550
We have a lot of people, so it's perfect.

676
00:32:21,550 --> 00:32:22,510
I don't think

677
00:32:22,640 --> 00:32:24,500
anyone likes losing in our class.

678
00:32:24,790 --> 00:32:26,390
I might not beat you in exams,

679
00:32:26,480 --> 00:32:28,240
but I'm pretty good at playing games.

680
00:32:28,240 --> 00:32:30,830
You've successfully ignited
my competitive spirit.

681
00:32:30,830 --> 00:32:31,550
Bring it on!

682
00:32:32,720 --> 00:32:33,380
Let's do it.

683
00:32:43,050 --> 00:32:45,070
[You can't talk more than 3 sentences
during the game.]

684
00:32:45,120 --> 00:32:47,420
[Touch each player's hand once]

685
00:32:55,900 --> 00:32:57,610
For every player, each of you

686
00:32:57,610 --> 00:32:59,200
only has one chance to call them out.

687
00:32:59,200 --> 00:33:01,930
If you are not sure,
please don't use it casually.

688
00:33:02,160 --> 00:33:03,160
Enjoy!

689
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:04,420
Thanks!

690
00:33:04,940 --> 00:33:05,470
Let's go.

691
00:33:05,880 --> 00:33:06,210
Okay.

692
00:33:08,680 --> 00:33:09,830
Princess.

693
00:33:09,900 --> 00:33:11,960
Her Royal Highness the Princess
has arrived.

694
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:13,180
Look at this.

695
00:33:13,480 --> 00:33:15,200
How about adding a little flower?

696
00:33:15,200 --> 00:33:17,380
This smell is not right.

697
00:33:18,680 --> 00:33:20,160
It can also block the sun.

698
00:33:20,590 --> 00:33:21,920
Wearing this...

699
00:33:22,350 --> 00:33:24,640
Looks so funny on you.

700
00:33:24,640 --> 00:33:26,030
What is that?

701
00:33:26,110 --> 00:33:27,270
A flower fairy.

702
00:33:30,480 --> 00:33:30,810
Here.

703
00:33:33,010 --> 00:33:33,900
Did you draw the mission

704
00:33:33,900 --> 00:33:37,240
where you have to
hide the weird-flavored candy on everyone?

705
00:33:37,240 --> 00:33:38,620
Hurry up. Let me pay.

706
00:33:39,700 --> 00:33:40,400
[Tang Tingting's Mission]

707
00:33:40,420 --> 00:33:43,760
[Hide the weird-flavored candy
on everyone]

708
00:33:43,790 --> 00:33:45,740
[without being discovered.]

709
00:33:47,720 --> 00:33:48,830
Tingting!

710
00:33:52,550 --> 00:33:53,750
Which one do you want?

711
00:33:54,720 --> 00:33:55,530
Anything is fine.

712
00:33:55,530 --> 00:33:56,400
This one.

713
00:33:58,160 --> 00:33:59,880
I think this one suits you.

714
00:34:00,060 --> 00:34:01,790
Sure. I'll take this one, then.

715
00:34:01,790 --> 00:34:02,590
How much is it?

716
00:34:03,270 --> 00:34:05,550
First, get out of this castle.

717
00:34:06,400 --> 00:34:08,150
And then

718
00:34:08,960 --> 00:34:11,159
let's go to the "Flooded Jinshan" ride.

719
00:34:11,510 --> 00:34:13,110
It's like a giant swing.

720
00:34:13,190 --> 00:34:14,510
Is it that scary?

721
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:16,600
You'll find out soon.

722
00:34:16,760 --> 00:34:19,440
There's a momentary feeling
of weightlessness on the pirate ship.

723
00:34:19,440 --> 00:34:20,440
Weightlessness?

724
00:34:20,960 --> 00:34:21,960
Sometimes when I dream,

725
00:34:21,960 --> 00:34:23,880
I wake up startled from falling.

726
00:34:24,710 --> 00:34:25,840
Would you be scared?

727
00:34:27,070 --> 00:34:27,870
Probably not.

728
00:34:29,960 --> 00:34:31,440
Every time I come to the amusement park,

729
00:34:31,440 --> 00:34:33,800
I imagine it as an astronaut test,

730
00:34:33,880 --> 00:34:35,010
so I won't be scared.

731
00:34:39,690 --> 00:34:41,020
Next group of visitors.

732
00:34:41,030 --> 00:34:42,560
Be careful and head inside.

733
00:34:43,170 --> 00:34:44,380
I suddenly don't feel so good.

734
00:34:44,380 --> 00:34:45,380
You guys go ahead.

735
00:34:45,380 --> 00:34:46,360
You can give me your stuff.

736
00:34:46,360 --> 00:34:47,560
I'll watch it for you.

737
00:34:47,860 --> 00:34:48,920
Sure.

738
00:34:50,960 --> 00:34:52,489
Can you hold this for me too?

739
00:34:53,659 --> 00:34:55,010
Hurry up.

740
00:34:55,670 --> 00:34:57,130
The ride is about to start.

741
00:35:03,840 --> 00:35:05,640
You guys wait for the next round.

742
00:35:08,620 --> 00:35:09,680
What are you doing?

743
00:35:12,480 --> 00:35:14,800
I... I bought candy for everyone.

744
00:35:14,800 --> 00:35:15,860
I'm passing it out.

745
00:35:17,110 --> 00:35:19,630
Are you trying to complete a mission?

746
00:35:20,960 --> 00:35:22,800
No way.

747
00:35:25,280 --> 00:35:27,550
Tang, you're being too obvious.

748
00:35:27,920 --> 00:35:28,880
Before we came, you said

749
00:35:28,880 --> 00:35:30,940
you wanted to go on all the rides here.

750
00:35:31,070 --> 00:35:32,530
This is only the first one.

751
00:35:36,670 --> 00:35:37,670
Please.

752
00:35:37,690 --> 00:35:39,030
Let me off this time.

753
00:35:39,150 --> 00:35:41,070
It's embarrassing
to be the first one caught.

754
00:35:41,070 --> 00:35:41,760
Nope!

755
00:35:43,230 --> 00:35:44,400
Your mission is...

756
00:35:45,550 --> 00:35:46,760
Are you sure you want to say it?

757
00:35:46,760 --> 00:35:48,190
Everyone only has one chance.

758
00:35:48,190 --> 00:35:50,720
If you guess wrong,
you'll waste your chance.

759
00:35:51,760 --> 00:35:54,880
To sneak everyone candy
without being discovered.

760
00:35:55,090 --> 00:35:55,280
[Tang Tingting's mission:
hide the weird-flavored candy
on everyone]

761
00:35:55,300 --> 00:35:55,490
[without being discovered.]

762
00:35:55,520 --> 00:35:56,700
[Fail]

763
00:35:59,800 --> 00:36:01,070
This is mine now.

764
00:36:01,610 --> 00:36:03,210
Give it to me.

765
00:36:08,420 --> 00:36:09,220
You're no fun.

766
00:36:49,280 --> 00:36:49,880
Was it fun?

767
00:36:50,360 --> 00:36:51,150
It was fun.

768
00:36:51,380 --> 00:36:53,480
I actually like
the feeling of weightlessness.

769
00:36:53,480 --> 00:36:55,550
Then you have the potential
to be an astronaut.

770
00:36:55,550 --> 00:36:56,800
Shen Fuxuan is the impressive one.

771
00:36:56,800 --> 00:36:58,860
He didn't make a sound the whole time.

772
00:36:59,150 --> 00:37:00,210
Are you not scared

773
00:37:00,550 --> 00:37:01,840
because you go on rides often,

774
00:37:01,840 --> 00:37:03,240
or because you're brave?

775
00:37:04,820 --> 00:37:05,500
[Shen Fuxuan's Mission]

776
00:37:05,530 --> 00:37:08,510
[You can't talk more than 3 sentences
during the game.]

777
00:37:18,780 --> 00:37:19,710
I'm brave.

778
00:37:19,560 --> 00:37:19,960
[Shen Fuxuan's Mission]

779
00:37:19,980 --> 00:37:20,560
[You can't talk more than 3 sentences
during the game.]

780
00:37:20,580 --> 00:37:20,950
[Shen Fuxuan: 2 sentences left]

781
00:37:24,440 --> 00:37:25,030
Here.

782
00:37:26,630 --> 00:37:28,320
No wonder you suddenly said
you were not playing earlier.

783
00:37:28,320 --> 00:37:29,480
So this is why.

784
00:37:30,440 --> 00:37:31,570
What's her mission?

785
00:37:31,590 --> 00:37:33,440
To slip candy into everyone's pockets

786
00:37:33,440 --> 00:37:34,770
without being noticed.

787
00:37:35,190 --> 00:37:36,990
But I caught her on the first try.

788
00:37:37,900 --> 00:37:39,070
It's just a side quest.

789
00:37:39,070 --> 00:37:40,070
Why so serious?

790
00:37:40,590 --> 00:37:42,320
You still need to be competitive.

791
00:37:42,320 --> 00:37:43,630
Stop showing off.

792
00:37:43,630 --> 00:37:45,420
I don't even care about this stupid badge.

793
00:37:45,420 --> 00:37:47,400
I just feel relieved now, okay?

794
00:37:47,400 --> 00:37:48,230
Sure, sure.

795
00:37:49,030 --> 00:37:49,710
Let's go.

796
00:37:49,920 --> 00:37:51,450
Next stop, roller coaster.

797
00:37:52,210 --> 00:37:52,760
Let's go.

798
00:38:06,190 --> 00:38:06,840
Shen.

799
00:38:07,230 --> 00:38:08,880
Well, are you scared?

800
00:38:09,960 --> 00:38:13,000
I heard this thing
always malfunctions overseas.

801
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:13,920
I don't know if it's safe.

802
00:38:13,920 --> 00:38:15,250
He's too scared to ride.

803
00:38:17,550 --> 00:38:18,320
I'm talking to you.

804
00:38:18,320 --> 00:38:19,650
Why are you ignoring me?

805
00:38:20,390 --> 00:38:21,960
You don't have to ride it
if you're scared.

806
00:38:21,960 --> 00:38:23,160
No one is forcing you.

807
00:38:24,850 --> 00:38:27,290
Acrophobia is half hereditary.

808
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:29,660
It's nothing to be ashamed of.

809
00:38:30,230 --> 00:38:31,840
Seems like you didn't take the pirate ship

810
00:38:31,840 --> 00:38:33,110
cause you were scared.

811
00:38:33,110 --> 00:38:35,530
You just happened
to catch me sneaking candy.

812
00:38:35,530 --> 00:38:36,340
Nonsense.

813
00:38:36,370 --> 00:38:39,030
I'm just a little excited
before getting on.

814
00:38:39,190 --> 00:38:41,760
Also, I'm just communicating with Shen.

815
00:38:42,690 --> 00:38:43,440
Right?

816
00:38:45,520 --> 00:38:46,480
[Please queue in twos]

817
00:38:50,190 --> 00:38:51,820
It must be fun.

818
00:39:02,230 --> 00:39:03,110
Duan Qiyan.

819
00:39:04,190 --> 00:39:06,360
Even though
I've never ridden a roller coaster,

820
00:39:06,360 --> 00:39:07,710
from my observation,

821
00:39:08,000 --> 00:39:10,000
the back row should be the scariest.

822
00:39:10,400 --> 00:39:11,960
Th-The scariest?

823
00:39:13,610 --> 00:39:15,320
When the front row starts to dive,

824
00:39:15,320 --> 00:39:16,590
the back row is still climbing,

825
00:39:16,590 --> 00:39:19,630
converting accumulated potential energy
into stronger acceleration.

826
00:39:19,630 --> 00:39:20,000
Wait.

827
00:39:20,000 --> 00:39:20,360
But—

828
00:39:22,240 --> 00:39:24,100
You want to take this seat, right?

829
00:39:25,210 --> 00:39:26,880
Let's switch, then!

830
00:39:27,590 --> 00:39:28,440
Have my seat.

831
00:39:28,460 --> 00:39:29,270
Go ahead.

832
00:39:39,760 --> 00:39:42,280
Sir, could we switch seats?

833
00:39:42,320 --> 00:39:43,190
Sure.

834
00:39:43,190 --> 00:39:44,000
Thank you.

835
00:41:04,190 --> 00:41:04,960
Are you okay?

836
00:41:06,920 --> 00:41:09,110
You obviously
can't handle high-altitude rides.

837
00:41:09,110 --> 00:41:10,360
Why force yourself?

838
00:41:11,960 --> 00:41:13,760
Guess you can't be an astronaut.

839
00:41:15,530 --> 00:41:17,990
Was your mission
to ride the roller coaster?

840
00:41:18,320 --> 00:41:20,850
Otherwise,
you wouldn't have dared to get on.

841
00:41:21,320 --> 00:41:22,440
It really isn't.

842
00:41:22,480 --> 00:41:23,400
You guessed wrong.

843
00:41:23,400 --> 00:41:24,670
You have no more chances left.

844
00:41:24,520 --> 00:41:25,580
[Shen Fuxuan's Mission]

845
00:41:25,600 --> 00:41:27,730
[You can't talk more than 3 sentences
during the game.]

846
00:41:27,760 --> 00:41:28,620
[Shen Fuxuan: 1 sentence left]

847
00:41:41,250 --> 00:41:42,360
I got it. Your mission is...

848
00:41:42,360 --> 00:41:43,190
Ms. Xia!

849
00:41:43,210 --> 00:41:44,030
No rush.

850
00:41:44,030 --> 00:41:45,190
There's still a long time left
in this game.

851
00:41:45,190 --> 00:41:46,150
Take your time to guess.

852
00:41:46,150 --> 00:41:47,800
If you guess wrong, you lose your chance.

853
00:41:47,800 --> 00:41:51,000
Your mission is to make
a peace sign on the roller coaster.

854
00:41:57,400 --> 00:41:58,360
You got it.

855
00:41:58,490 --> 00:41:59,420
Hand it over.

856
00:42:01,080 --> 00:42:02,250
Hand it over!

857
00:42:02,280 --> 00:42:03,030
Stop!

858
00:42:03,550 --> 00:42:04,710
-You lost.
-Slow down!

859
00:42:04,710 --> 00:42:05,480
Watch my...

860
00:42:07,710 --> 00:42:08,880
Why did you pinch me?

861
00:42:09,110 --> 00:42:10,670
You finally get what you deserve.

862
00:42:10,670 --> 00:42:11,480
Two.

863
00:42:22,000 --> 00:42:23,000
Not bad, Shen.

864
00:42:23,510 --> 00:42:24,400
I guess it's not 100%,

865
00:42:24,400 --> 00:42:24,880
but...

866
00:42:24,880 --> 00:42:25,740
you're not bad.

867
00:43:12,760 --> 00:43:14,480
I have one question.

868
00:43:14,900 --> 00:43:16,780
Just now when we were playing bumper cars,

869
00:43:16,780 --> 00:43:18,910
why did you guys keep crashing into me?

870
00:43:19,400 --> 00:43:21,190
-We didn't.
-We didn't.

871
00:43:21,500 --> 00:43:22,190
Yes, you did.

872
00:43:22,190 --> 00:43:23,670
My back is all red.

873
00:43:24,530 --> 00:43:25,610
So fragile.

874
00:43:25,670 --> 00:43:26,510
Shen Fuxuan.

875
00:43:27,550 --> 00:43:29,810
Help get everyone their ice cream cones.

876
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:30,670
Sure.

877
00:43:32,190 --> 00:43:33,070
[Shen Fuxuan's Mission]

878
00:43:33,100 --> 00:43:34,700
[You can't talk more than 3 sentences
during the game.]

879
00:43:34,720 --> 00:43:35,620
[Shen Fuxuan: 0 sentences left]

880
00:43:36,070 --> 00:43:37,170
You kept blocking my way.

881
00:43:37,170 --> 00:43:38,820
So I had to crash into you.

882
00:43:38,940 --> 00:43:39,730
I was just...

883
00:43:41,670 --> 00:43:42,320
Thanks.

884
00:43:42,320 --> 00:43:43,340
What about mine, Jiang?

885
00:43:43,340 --> 00:43:44,000
Over there.

886
00:43:49,730 --> 00:43:51,780
My back still hurts from the crash.

887
00:43:54,380 --> 00:43:56,890
Hello. Can you come over here for a sec?

888
00:44:01,230 --> 00:44:01,650
Sure.

889
00:44:09,230 --> 00:44:10,160
What's going on?

890
00:44:11,730 --> 00:44:13,610
Hello.

891
00:44:14,380 --> 00:44:17,010
I feel a connection with you.

892
00:44:17,920 --> 00:44:20,290
Although not as much
as with the guy opposite you,

893
00:44:20,290 --> 00:44:22,360
the athletic high schooler...

894
00:44:22,550 --> 00:44:24,480
You're making that up, aren't you?

895
00:44:26,630 --> 00:44:28,440
I want to be friends with you.

896
00:44:28,480 --> 00:44:31,280
Can I get your contact info?

897
00:44:41,360 --> 00:44:41,960
He gave it.

898
00:44:43,760 --> 00:44:46,070
Jiang is very charming.

899
00:44:46,900 --> 00:44:47,700
Wow, for real?

900
00:44:52,760 --> 00:44:54,220
Let's ride the drop tower.

901
00:44:54,780 --> 00:44:55,640
Sure, let's go!

902
00:44:55,960 --> 00:44:57,190
Let's go!

903
00:44:57,760 --> 00:44:59,720
Come on, we've rested enough. Let's go.

904
00:44:59,720 --> 00:45:00,300
Go.

905
00:45:04,710 --> 00:45:05,300
Where to?

906
00:45:05,550 --> 00:45:06,410
The drop tower.

907
00:45:09,050 --> 00:45:09,710
Jiang.

908
00:45:09,940 --> 00:45:11,920
The gentle senior type like you

909
00:45:11,920 --> 00:45:13,650
is really attractive to girls.

910
00:45:13,650 --> 00:45:14,760
What are you talking about?

911
00:45:14,760 --> 00:45:15,490
What is that?

912
00:45:15,590 --> 00:45:17,390
Don't you think so, Shen Fuxuan?

913
00:45:19,630 --> 00:45:20,800
Why are you acting so weird today?

914
00:45:20,800 --> 00:45:22,030
You haven't said a word.

915
00:45:22,030 --> 00:45:22,960
Did I offend you?

916
00:45:27,670 --> 00:45:28,500
Wait a minute.

917
00:45:31,840 --> 00:45:34,070
Are you doing the side mission?

918
00:45:37,750 --> 00:45:38,590
I got it.

919
00:45:39,400 --> 00:45:41,460
Your mission is to not speak for a day.

920
00:45:43,360 --> 00:45:44,280
He did speak.

921
00:45:44,670 --> 00:45:45,440
Did he?

922
00:45:48,820 --> 00:45:49,960
Let me think...

923
00:45:50,850 --> 00:45:52,270
[Exit]

924
00:45:50,980 --> 00:45:53,610
Are you not scared
because you go on rides often,

925
00:45:53,610 --> 00:45:55,010
or because you're brave?

926
00:45:58,320 --> 00:45:59,300
I'm brave.

927
00:45:59,760 --> 00:46:03,170
[Shen Fuxuan's 1st sentence]

928
00:46:00,440 --> 00:46:02,510
Is your task to ride the roller coaster?

929
00:46:02,510 --> 00:46:03,670
Otherwise, you definitely wouldn't get on.

930
00:46:03,250 --> 00:46:09,220
[Shen Fuxuan's 2nd sentence]

931
00:46:04,150 --> 00:46:07,150
Shen Fuxuan.
Help get everyone their ice cream cones.

932
00:46:07,920 --> 00:46:08,760
Sure.

933
00:46:09,220 --> 00:46:17,840
[Shen Fuxuan's 3rd sentence]

934
00:46:14,840 --> 00:46:16,230
Is your task

935
00:46:16,230 --> 00:46:17,980
not to speak more than 3 sentences a day?

936
00:46:17,980 --> 00:46:18,900
[Shen Fuxuan's Mission]

937
00:46:18,920 --> 00:46:19,930
[You can't talk more than 3 sentences
during the game.]

938
00:46:19,960 --> 00:46:21,180
[Fail]

939
00:46:24,860 --> 00:46:25,840
Good memory.

940
00:46:26,880 --> 00:46:27,710
Hand it over.

941
00:46:34,000 --> 00:46:34,480
Thanks.

942
00:46:40,660 --> 00:46:41,260
Let's go.

943
00:46:41,290 --> 00:46:41,840
Let's go.

944
00:46:44,780 --> 00:46:45,560
We're here!

945
00:46:47,590 --> 00:46:49,670
Wow, that's so high.

946
00:46:52,960 --> 00:46:54,530
I... I need the toilet.

947
00:46:57,110 --> 00:46:58,570
Are you too scared to ride?

948
00:46:59,190 --> 00:47:01,070
How is that possible?

949
00:47:01,610 --> 00:47:02,340
I just ate

950
00:47:02,340 --> 00:47:04,130
too much ice cream just now.

951
00:47:04,130 --> 00:47:05,510
My stomach is a bit upset.

952
00:47:05,510 --> 00:47:06,670
I'll be right back.

953
00:47:08,610 --> 00:47:10,000
He's just scared.

954
00:47:10,070 --> 00:47:11,950
He's been a coward since childhood.

955
00:47:11,950 --> 00:47:12,770
You guys go first.

956
00:47:12,770 --> 00:47:14,550
I must drag him up here today.

957
00:47:14,570 --> 00:47:15,610
I'll help you.

958
00:47:19,230 --> 00:47:20,030
Then how about

959
00:47:20,670 --> 00:47:22,000
the two of us ride first?

960
00:47:29,330 --> 00:47:31,390
Jiang Yubai, you're really popular.

961
00:47:39,010 --> 00:47:40,260
Even a passerby

962
00:47:41,000 --> 00:47:43,000
wants to exchange numbers with you.

963
00:47:43,670 --> 00:47:46,330
I feel like you can make friends
wherever you go.

964
00:47:48,230 --> 00:47:51,440
Actually... I didn't give her my number.

965
00:47:54,420 --> 00:47:55,590
I just feel

966
00:47:56,210 --> 00:47:58,870
it's quite awkward
to reject someone in public.

967
00:47:58,960 --> 00:47:59,880
So I left her

968
00:47:59,880 --> 00:48:01,150
our school's number.

969
00:48:03,550 --> 00:48:06,590
But actually, it's fine
if you left your own number.

970
00:48:07,960 --> 00:48:10,070
I read in a book before:

971
00:48:10,590 --> 00:48:11,880
most friends

972
00:48:11,960 --> 00:48:14,710
can only accompany you
for a part of your life's journey.

973
00:48:14,710 --> 00:48:16,400
When they reach their destination,

974
00:48:16,400 --> 00:48:17,630
they will get off,

975
00:48:19,400 --> 00:48:21,200
and watch you go to the next stop.

976
00:48:25,190 --> 00:48:26,590
You will definitely have

977
00:48:26,670 --> 00:48:28,510
even more friends in the future.

978
00:48:29,920 --> 00:48:31,030
I hope by then,

979
00:48:31,760 --> 00:48:33,490
I can still be your best friend—

980
00:48:38,510 --> 00:48:39,170
one of them.

981
00:48:52,940 --> 00:48:53,650
It stopped.

982
00:48:57,630 --> 00:48:58,710
I-It's so high.

983
00:49:00,630 --> 00:49:01,490
Are you scared?

984
00:49:04,480 --> 00:49:05,280
No.

985
00:49:11,670 --> 00:49:13,000
Actually, a little bit.

986
00:49:18,000 --> 00:49:20,000
Do you have any unfulfilled wishes?

987
00:49:20,480 --> 00:49:23,070
That sounds like an unlucky thing
to be talking about now.

988
00:49:23,070 --> 00:49:23,960
I'm a bit nervous.

989
00:49:23,960 --> 00:49:25,670
I want to distract myself.

990
00:49:27,510 --> 00:49:28,440
All right, then.

991
00:49:28,670 --> 00:49:29,480
Go ahead.

992
00:49:29,840 --> 00:49:30,900
I'll chat with you.

993
00:49:34,150 --> 00:49:35,810
Do you have any other secrets?

994
00:49:38,230 --> 00:49:39,880
I don't think so.

995
00:49:40,280 --> 00:49:41,140
What about you?

996
00:49:42,630 --> 00:49:43,440
I...

997
00:49:44,710 --> 00:49:46,900
Does being about to fall asleep
in a second count?

998
00:49:46,900 --> 00:49:48,110
How does that count?

999
00:49:51,630 --> 00:49:52,320
By the way,

1000
00:49:54,150 --> 00:49:55,280
though you just said

1001
00:49:56,440 --> 00:49:58,570
that all friends last just for a phase,

1002
00:49:59,760 --> 00:50:00,800
I want to say...

1003
00:50:06,110 --> 00:50:06,920
I want to

1004
00:50:08,110 --> 00:50:09,240
be with you forever.

1005
00:50:13,590 --> 00:50:15,590
You will always be my one and only...

1006
00:50:16,600 --> 00:50:17,760
best friend.

1007
00:50:54,230 --> 00:50:56,610
So this is what it feels like
to ride a drop tower.

1008
00:50:56,610 --> 00:50:58,270
When we were up there just now,

1009
00:50:58,320 --> 00:51:00,780
for a moment,
I thought we'd never come down.

1010
00:51:08,360 --> 00:51:10,320
I saw you were scared, so I...

1011
00:51:13,320 --> 00:51:14,850
I'm glad you were by my side.

1012
00:51:20,550 --> 00:51:22,590
Duan Qiyan, it's a good thing
you didn't go on the drop tower.

1013
00:51:22,590 --> 00:51:23,840
Otherwise, you would've cried.

1014
00:51:23,840 --> 00:51:24,770
Is it that scary?

1015
00:51:25,030 --> 00:51:26,230
No point telling you.

1016
00:51:26,320 --> 00:51:27,440
You didn't even dare to ride it.

1017
00:51:27,440 --> 00:51:28,180
Why bother asking?

1018
00:51:28,180 --> 00:51:29,440
Cut the crap.

1019
00:51:29,440 --> 00:51:31,400
You've been moping all day

1020
00:51:31,510 --> 00:51:32,840
and haven't said a word.

1021
00:51:32,840 --> 00:51:33,710
You really held it in

1022
00:51:33,710 --> 00:51:34,840
just for a side quest.

1023
00:51:34,840 --> 00:51:35,550
Cut the crap.

1024
00:51:35,550 --> 00:51:37,000
I didn't want to talk today anyway.

1025
00:51:37,000 --> 00:51:37,630
Sure.

1026
00:51:37,840 --> 00:51:39,230
Keep telling yourself that.

1027
00:51:39,230 --> 00:51:41,070
This quest would've killed you
in 10 minutes.

1028
00:51:41,070 --> 00:51:42,930
I'm not as competitive as you are!

1029
00:51:44,590 --> 00:51:45,550
You guys are out.

1030
00:51:45,800 --> 00:51:46,670
How was it today?

1031
00:51:46,670 --> 00:51:47,670
Did you have fun?

1032
00:51:47,710 --> 00:51:49,310
It was fun, just a bit tiring.

1033
00:51:51,260 --> 00:51:52,720
Seems like today's winner

1034
00:51:52,760 --> 00:51:53,840
is this lady.

1035
00:51:55,680 --> 00:51:56,550
No, no.

1036
00:51:56,920 --> 00:51:58,070
I didn't finish my mission,

1037
00:51:58,070 --> 00:51:59,330
so it shouldn't count.

1038
00:52:00,190 --> 00:52:01,390
What's your mission?

1039
00:52:02,630 --> 00:52:04,830
To exchange something with each of you.

1040
00:52:04,840 --> 00:52:07,370
But I couldn't find a chance
with Jiang Yubai.

1041
00:52:09,840 --> 00:52:11,370
I think this suits you well.

1042
00:52:11,800 --> 00:52:13,800
That works. Let's go with this then.

1043
00:52:14,170 --> 00:52:15,070
My headband.

1044
00:52:17,800 --> 00:52:20,150
Shen Fuxuan,
my gun doesn't seem to work well.

1045
00:52:20,150 --> 00:52:21,320
Can we swap?

1046
00:52:25,400 --> 00:52:25,860
The gun?

1047
00:52:26,880 --> 00:52:27,670
Wait.

1048
00:52:28,760 --> 00:52:30,030
What did we exchange?

1049
00:52:30,920 --> 00:52:32,180
Roller coaster seats.

1050
00:52:32,400 --> 00:52:34,110
You want to take this seat, right?

1051
00:52:34,110 --> 00:52:35,840
Let's switch, then!

1052
00:52:38,400 --> 00:52:39,360
That's too subtle.

1053
00:52:39,360 --> 00:52:40,620
Who would notice that?

1054
00:52:42,280 --> 00:52:44,710
Actually,
you exchanged something with me too.

1055
00:52:44,710 --> 00:52:45,710
On the drop tower,

1056
00:52:46,000 --> 00:52:47,600
didn't we exchange secrets?

1057
00:52:50,070 --> 00:52:52,000
You will always be my one and only...

1058
00:52:52,000 --> 00:52:53,110
best friend.

1059
00:53:02,570 --> 00:53:03,590
Jiang.

1060
00:53:03,920 --> 00:53:06,650
You're even helping
your opponent make up for it.

1061
00:53:07,630 --> 00:53:09,710
Looks like Lin Zhixia
is 1st place again today,

1062
00:53:09,710 --> 00:53:11,070
and I'm Ms. Last Place again.

1063
00:53:11,070 --> 00:53:12,360
Isn't that normal?

1064
00:53:13,920 --> 00:53:15,250
So what's your mission?

1065
00:53:19,070 --> 00:53:19,840
Me?

1066
00:53:20,030 --> 00:53:21,090
Hand it over!

1067
00:53:21,230 --> 00:53:21,600
[Jiang Yubai's Mission]

1068
00:53:21,630 --> 00:53:22,200
[Touch each player's hand once]
[Duan Qiyan]

1069
00:53:22,230 --> 00:53:23,220
[Touch each player's hand once]
[Tang Tingting]

1070
00:53:23,250 --> 00:53:24,020
[Touch each player's hand once]
[Shen Fuxuan]

1071
00:53:25,300 --> 00:53:27,230
I didn't finish my mission either.

1072
00:53:29,630 --> 00:53:30,240
[Jiang Yubai's Mission]

1073
00:53:30,260 --> 00:53:31,950
[Touch each player's hand once]
[Lin Zhixia]

1074
00:53:33,230 --> 00:53:33,860
What is it?

1075
00:53:35,910 --> 00:53:37,370
To tell a joke to everyone.

1076
00:53:39,840 --> 00:53:40,260
A joke?

1077
00:53:41,630 --> 00:53:42,590
You really weren't

1078
00:53:42,590 --> 00:53:44,210
participating in this game at all.

1079
00:53:44,210 --> 00:53:45,540
It makes me look stupid.

1080
00:53:45,650 --> 00:53:47,690
That's so boring of you.

1081
00:53:48,440 --> 00:53:49,570
This isn't like you.

1082
00:53:50,670 --> 00:53:51,930
I didn't perform well.

1083
00:53:52,960 --> 00:53:55,020
Do you guys want to take a group photo?

1084
00:53:55,320 --> 00:53:56,610
I'll give it to you for free.

1085
00:53:56,610 --> 00:53:57,030
Sure!

1086
00:53:57,610 --> 00:53:58,670
Let's go. Come this way.

1087
00:53:58,670 --> 00:53:59,000
Okay!

1088
00:53:59,100 --> 00:54:00,780
Can't say no to free.

1089
00:54:01,390 --> 00:54:02,610
Find your spots.

1090
00:54:02,610 --> 00:54:03,800
Strike a pose.

1091
00:54:04,000 --> 00:54:06,110
Three, two, one.

1092
00:54:10,210 --> 00:54:13,210
I suddenly wish
time could freeze at this moment.

1093
00:54:14,500 --> 00:54:16,100
Not because it is so perfect,

1094
00:54:16,280 --> 00:54:17,940
but so that when my future self

1095
00:54:18,030 --> 00:54:20,480
looks at this photo on some evening,

1096
00:54:21,260 --> 00:54:23,630
I can still hear the laughter
of this moment

1097
00:54:23,630 --> 00:54:26,430
and feel the warmth
of someone staying close to me.

1098
00:54:29,440 --> 00:54:30,510
The years are long.

1099
00:54:31,510 --> 00:54:34,440
It is these shining fragments
captured by the camera

1100
00:54:35,210 --> 00:54:38,360
that illuminate the highlights
of our lives.

1101
00:55:16,460 --> 00:55:18,110
Why aren't you asleep yet?

1102
00:55:18,400 --> 00:55:19,460
Explain yourself.

1103
00:55:19,800 --> 00:55:20,840
Curfew is at 9 PM.

1104
00:55:21,360 --> 00:55:22,420
What time is it now?

1105
00:55:23,880 --> 00:55:25,000
I had things to do today.

1106
00:55:25,000 --> 00:55:26,460
I already told Mom and Dad.

1107
00:55:26,840 --> 00:55:27,770
Is that a reason?

1108
00:55:27,780 --> 00:55:28,360
Yes.

1109
00:55:32,670 --> 00:55:34,130
Don't let it happen again.

1110
00:55:35,710 --> 00:55:36,530
Are you waiting for me?

1111
00:55:36,530 --> 00:55:37,120
No.

1112
00:55:42,470 --> 00:55:43,730
I'm admiring the moon.

1113
00:55:53,670 --> 00:55:54,800
Keep admiring then.

1114
00:56:07,630 --> 00:56:08,210
[Certificate of Honor]

1115
00:56:08,230 --> 00:56:08,960
